# > >> Google Gemini / Google AI (PROXY)

# 来源（多源交叉核验 + 去重合并）:
#   1. blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script  rule/QuantumultX/Gemini/Gemini.list
#   2. storevip/Quantumult-X-Rules    AI.list  (Google AI 段)
#   3. jimmyzhou521-stack/ai-projects-proxy-rules
#   4. jnlaoshu/MySelf QuantumultX/Rule/AIGC.list
# 策略组: PROXY（与你配置里名字不一致请全局替换）
# 更新: 2026-09-09

# --------------------
# Gemini 网页 / App
# --------------------
HOST,gemini.google.com,PROXY
HOST-SUFFIX,gemini.google,PROXY
HOST-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com,PROXY
HOST-SUFFIX,gemini.gstatic.com,PROXY
HOST-SUFFIX,bard.google.com,PROXY

